                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is so good.. I only wish the developers would change the color of gravity wells back to red where they are easily seen. Seriously, they went BLUE crazy, it's everywhere. There's literally a blue haze that acts as a overlay over the entire game. Who cares about deep black levels? Not them. Does nobody remember how beautiful GW2 was? And that was before OLED became accessible! Just change the gravity wells back to red at least? I've broken world records in this IP, even held one for 5 years straight. I'm TELLING you that it's poorly visible and I would pay someone to change it for me if it were even possible..  Forget about the other complaints (I have more) just drop the blue down a couple notches please, allow just ONE PIXLE on the screen to be black?",
